            "categoryId": "57",
            "categoryTitle": "Homepage Articles - Edit Only",
            "introtext": "\t<div class=\"welcome-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"welcome-title\">\n<h3 class=\"g-title\">Welcome</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"welcome-content\">\n<p>Welcome to St. Wenceslaus Roman Catholic Church in Dickinson, North Dakota. Whether you're visiting or looking for a parish home, we invite you to worship with us and live the fullness of the Catholic faith.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
